    "History, pinboards, search and paste all work. The trial is free and never charges or renews on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El historial, los tableros, la búsqueda y pegar funcionan. La prueba es gratuita y nunca cobra ni renueva automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기록, 핀보드, 검색, 붙여넣기를 모두 사용할 수 있습니다. 체험은 무료이며 자동으로 결제되거나 갱신되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "历史记录、钉板、搜索和粘贴均可使用。试用免费，不会自动扣费或续订。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歷史紀錄、釘選板、搜尋和貼上均可使用。試用免費，不會自動扣費或續訂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold ⇧ while pasting to switch for a single paste." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
